        "value": "合　米大豆　一萬五千三百八十五石壹斗九升八合七勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "合　米・大豆　一万五千三百八十五石一斗九升八合七勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total, rice and soybeans: 15,385.1987 koku. The heading 合 stands above this column and covers both this grain total and the cash total in the next column to the left. The figure is Funai Domain's whole tax take in grain, and the components print on the preceding half-page (upper_p223_left): the regular land tax of 12,726.7667 koku of rice and 2,111.962 koku of soybeans, plus the miscellaneous tax of 445.479 koku of rice and 100.991 koku of soybeans, sum to 15,385.1987 exactly."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "府内藩合米大豆"
      }
    ],
