      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total, cash: 1,949 ryo, plus 243.15 mon in ei copper. The figure adds the two miscellaneous cash taxes printed on the preceding half-page (126 ryo 43.08 mon of fixed komonari and 455 ryo 959.07 mon of variable komonari) to the two product lines on this page (1,167 ryo 522 mon and 199 ryo 719 mon). Those come to 1,947 ryo and 2,243.15 mon of ei copper, and carrying 2,000 mon into 2 ryo gives 1,949 ryo 243.15 mon exactly."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "府内藩合金"
