    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "此米四十九石六升七勺三才　石札平均五百六十七匁八分　兩札百四十匁"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "此の米　四十九石六升七勺三才　石札平均五百六十七匁八分　両札百四十匁"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "[double-column note] This converts to 49.06073 koku of rice; the rice price in domain notes averages 567.8 monme per koku, and one ryo in notes is reckoned at 140 monme. This is the cash tax expressed in rice, and adding it to the two rice tax figures gives the grand total below exactly. The stated rate does not quite reproduce the stated conversion: 198.62588 ryo at 140 monme per ryo is 27,807.62 monme, which at 567.8 monme per koku gives 48.974 koku, while 566.8 gives 49.06073 to the last digit. The printed glyph is unmistakably 七, so the one-monme gap is in the domain's own rounded price, not in the reading."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此米換算註"
      }
    ],
