      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "[bracket rule, no text of its own on this page] The tail of the fusen bracket that begins on the preceding half-page. On upper_p223_left the same rule is captioned 付箋 (\"attached slip\") and runs leftward over Funai Domain's 正租 and 雜税 columns; here it continues in from the right margin and terminates in a downward hook at x1659, so it takes in the four Funai columns on this page - 産物 琉球表, 生蠟, 合 米大豆 and 合 金. It records that those figures were transcribed from a paper slip attached to the original manuscript."
